{"name": "I Am Machine", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"376\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993990/extras/1acc98ed990317b37275fc61a175219e.avif?t=1762437770\" width=\"1232\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In I Am Machine, an isometric rogue-lite adventure, play as Erik, a lone survivor in a post-apocalyptic world overrun by machines. With humanity on the brink of extinction, Erik must confront brutal mechanical foes as he embarks on a quest to save his kidnapped daughter. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your choices will determine his fate. Arm yourself with powerful weapons, enhance your abilities, and forge unlikely alliances as you battle deadly enemies across unforgiving environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"360\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993990/extras/b38cd7f8cd0d93b0c85ff6ee54cbc728.poster.avif?t=1762437770\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993990/extras/b38cd7f8cd0d93b0c85ff6ee54cbc728.webm?t=1762437770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993990/extras/b38cd7f8cd0d93b0c85ff6ee54cbc728.mp4?t=1762437770\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"128\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993990/extras/62e2cbeca8eff762156ce502522e8d3e.avif?t=1762437770\" width=\"1171\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in fast-paced, isometric combat where no two encounters are the same. Wield a mix of melee and ranged weapons, customizing Erik\u2019s arsenal with over 100 boons to suit your style. Each biome presents unique challenges and mechanical threats, testing your resilience with new dangers and rewards at every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"360\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993990/extras/7d05d88a61aeb384b002bfd2078ee0bb.poster.avif?t=1762437770\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993990/extras/7d05d88a61aeb384b002bfd2078ee0bb.webm?t=1762437770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993990/extras/7d05d88a61aeb384b002bfd2078ee0bb.mp4?t=1762437770\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"128\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993990/extras/b0fe1528a1679c16cc42adbd3260e705.avif?t=1762437770\" width=\"1171\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect scrap from your fallen foes to craft wicked defenses \u2014 turrets, lasers, you name it. Strategically place your creations to permanently bolster your stronghold, helping you outlast the ruthless machines determined to scrap you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993990/extras/fdf037de1274e39aee1ff81839aee948.poster.avif?t=1762437770\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993990/extras/fdf037de1274e39aee1ff81839aee948.webm?t=1762437770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993990/extras/fdf037de1274e39aee1ff81839aee948.mp4?t=1762437770\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"128\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993990/extras/312ec6234ef440f2ca1db50a8aadb692.avif?t=1762437770\" width=\"1171\"/></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Capture an enemy\u2019s ability, then use it against its own kind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993990/extras/6022bb60a45ef2b0c00dfff2643ec787.poster.avif?t=1762437770\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993990/extras/6022bb60a45ef2b0c00dfff2643ec787.webm?t=1762437770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993990/extras/6022bb60a45ef2b0c00dfff2643ec787.mp4?t=1762437770\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"128\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993990/extras/168fb1f6bdf9277bc41ffb3d872b3c62.avif?t=1762437770\" width=\"1172\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wander through the post-apocalyptic world and chat with an eclectic bunch of survivors. Swap stories, share secrets, and piece together the wild history of a world that's far from lifeless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993990/extras/1bb4f93002b08d1eb58a8053fc22e7f9.poster.avif?t=1762437770\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993990/extras/1bb4f93002b08d1eb58a8053fc22e7f9.webm?t=1762437770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993990/extras/1bb4f93002b08d1eb58a8053fc22e7f9.mp4?t=1762437770\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"128\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993990/extras/fbcbd37c0a6c1a1e91caa5247e8045fb.avif?t=1762437770\" width=\"1172\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Repair and upgrade your hideout as you collect loot, unlocking essential goodies that beef up your defenses and power up your arsenal for the relentless battles ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993990/extras/97a3dec2be9ae403c0258d04c2de3199.poster.avif?t=1762437770\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993990/extras/97a3dec2be9ae403c0258d04c2de3199.webm?t=1762437770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993990/extras/97a3dec2be9ae403c0258d04c2de3199.mp4?t=1762437770\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Fight through a machine-ruled world in this isometric rogue-lite adventure. As Erik, a man-turned-robot, outsmart waves of enemies and adapt to ever-changing levels. Change the world before it changes you in this relentless quest for vengeance.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st